*Desenho Técnico*, organized by Hélio Etchepare and João Batista Gravina. [Institutionally hosted Portuguese handout at IFSC](https://docente.ifsc.edu.br/cleverson.guandalin/fic/desenho/Apostila_Desenho_Tecnico.pdf), 17 PDF pages. A printed edition date has not been established; file metadata alone is not an edition statement.

Read the complete short illustrated introduction for technical drawing, views/projections and dimensioning vocabulary, then deepen through the NPL guide and actual part/assembly drawings. Relate the Portuguese terms to the English design sources.

Retrieved outside the repository on 30 October 2026. Front matter, selected text and the projection illustrations were inspected. Public institutional hosting establishes an available reading copy, not blanket adaptation rights; no general open licence was established. The PDF and its illustrations remain external. Check the applicable drawing convention separately for real production work.

